  m_text: A girl named Monica put in a request for you to bring her some general
    food rations and some supplies for her to cook with. She seems to hail from a
    colony in New New Nassau and that's a new route for you. She added a special
    mention about cake mix because her daughter finished her course on surviving
    in the wind.
